    "description": "You are purchasing a \"Mixed Crystal and Mineral Specimen Lot with Amethyst and Quartz\" in \"Used\" condition.\nBeautiful mixed lot of natural crystals and mineral specimens, perfect for collectors, crystal healers, crafters, or anyone who loves unique stones. This assortment includes a variety of clear and smoky quartz points, polished and raw amethyst pieces, geode and agate slices, small clusters, and rough matrix specimens. The largest amethyst cluster is a striking display piece, and several of the quartz points are substantial in size, making them great for altars, decor, grids, or photography props. The collection offers a nice range of textures and shapes: from polished wands and points to raw, sparkly clusters and rugged matrix. Ideal as a starter collection, to resell individually, or to add depth and interest to an existing crystal display. Please note: this listing is for the entire lot shown together, including multiple individual stones and clusters in varying sizes. Keywords: crystal lot, mineral collection, quartz points, amethyst cluster, geode slice, agate slice, raw crystals, polished crystal, metaphysical decor, altar stones, specimen lot\nCondition Notes:\nLot of assorted crystals and mineral specimens including clear quartz points and clusters, amethyst points and clusters, geode halves, small tumbled pieces, and rough matrix stones. Surfaces show natural inclusions, internal fractures, and variations in color typical of mineral specimens. Some edges and tips have minor chips and rough spots. Matrix pieces have uneven, rough backs with natural pitting and texture. Overall presents as a mixed collection of display and healing stones with normal handling and storage wear.\nAspects:",
